      <title>Intel Thermald 2.5.13 恢复意外删除的 Wildcat Lake 支持</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/geek001/post/20260911/Intel-Thermald-2.5.13-%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E6%84%8F%E5%A4%96%E5%88%A0%E9%99%A4%E7%9A%84-Wildcat-Lake-%E6%94%AF%E6%8C%81/</link>
